# Local Mockoon: leave the feature file on literal numbers
# (09121111111 …). The Given step uses the quoted value as-is.
#
# Real / staging cellnumbers: set keys here, then quote the key in Gherkin
# instead of the phone number.
# Ex:  Given a checkout customer with cell number "CELL_S01"
#
# CELL_S01=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S02=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S03=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S04=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S05=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S06=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S07=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S08=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S09=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S10=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S11=0912xxxxxxx
# CELL_S12=0912xxxxxxx
